    "type": "question",
    "label": "22",
    "prompt": "Simplify the following. $\\dfrac{c^3\\times c^4}{c^5}$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$c^2$, $c\\ne0$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{c^3\\times c^4}{c^5}&=c^{3+4-5}\\\\\\frac{c^3\\times c^4}{c^5}&=c^2\\end{align*}$$The original denominator requires $c\\ne0$.",
